<!-- src/pages/aboutus/aboutus.wxml -->
<view class="about-page">
  <view class="hero">
    <van-image width="100%" height="100%" fit="cover" lazy-load show-loading src="{{aboutusImage}}" />
    <view class="hero-mask"></view>
    <view class="hero-content">
      <text class="hero-kicker">FAMILY · CULTURE · GROWTH</text>
      <text class="hero-title">嘉谦若竹</text>
      <text class="hero-brand">JQ MUSE+</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="page-content">
    <view class="intro-card">
      <view class="quote-mark">“</view>
      <text class="intro-cn">“嘉谦若竹”亲子共学，面向同频成长型妈妈，深耕家庭家风建设与高品质文化研学。</text>
      <text class="intro-en">JQ MUSE+ is a parent–child cultural learning community where growth-minded mothers and children explore culture, strengthen family values, and grow together.</text>
    </view>

    <view class="content-card">
      <view class="section first-section">
        <view class="section-heading">
          <view class="heading-line"></view>
          <view class="heading-texts">
            <text class="section-title">嘉谦若竹</text>
            <text class="section-title-en">THE NAME &amp; SPIRIT</text>
          </view>
        </view>

        <view class="meaning-item">
          <text class="meaning-key">嘉</text>
          <text class="meaning-text">取《诗经》“嘉乐君子”之美善品格</text>
        </view>
        <view class="meaning-item">
          <text class="meaning-key">谦</text>
          <text class="meaning-text">取《周易》“谦谦君子”之谦逊自省</text>
        </view>
        <view class="meaning-item">
          <text class="meaning-key">若竹</text>
          <text class="meaning-text">源自《楚辞·七谏·初放》“孰知其不合兮，若竹柏之异心”。竹虚心有容、坚韧有节，喻人向下扎根、向上生长，历经风雨而不改风骨。</text>
        </view>

        <view class="brand-grid">
          <view class="brand-item">
            <text class="brand-key">JQ</text>
            <text class="brand-desc">Inspired by two children, JQ also stands for JiaQian and Journey &amp; Quest—outward exploration and inward discovery.</text>
          </view>
          <view class="brand-item">
            <text class="brand-key">MUSE+</text>
            <text class="brand-desc">MUSE is inspiration and Mothers United through Study and Exploration. The “+” connects children, families and cultural partners in shared growth across generations.</text>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="section">
        <view class="section-heading">
          <view class="heading-line"></view>
          <view class="heading-texts">
            <text class="section-title">四维 BL 成长体系</text>
            <text class="section-title-en">4D BL GROWTH FRAMEWORK</text>
          </view>
        </view>

        <view class="bl-list">
          <view class="bl-item">
            <text class="bl-code">RBL</text>
            <view class="bl-content">
              <text class="bl-name">根文化学习 · Roots-Based Learning</text>
              <text class="bl-desc">根文化研学｜立根铸魂</text>
              <text class="bl-desc-en">Cultural Roots Learning | Building Identity and Character</text>
            </view>
          </view>
          <view class="bl-item">
            <text class="bl-code">PBL</text>
            <view class="bl-content">
              <text class="bl-name">项目式学习 · Project-Based Learning</text>
              <text class="bl-desc">项目式研学｜知行合一</text>
              <text class="bl-desc-en">Project-Based Learning | Turning Knowledge into Action</text>
            </view>
          </view>
          <view class="bl-item">
            <text class="bl-code">EBL</text>
            <view class="bl-content">
              <text class="bl-name">探索式学习 · Exploration-Based Learning</text>
              <text class="bl-desc">探索式成长｜唤醒内驱</text>
              <text class="bl-desc-en">Experiential Exploration | Awakening Inner Motivation</text>
            </view>
          </view>
          <view class="bl-item">
            <text class="bl-code">CBL</text>
            <view class="bl-content">
              <text class="bl-name">能力式学习 · Competency-Based Learning</text>
              <text class="bl-desc">能力式沉淀｜素养复利</text>
              <text class="bl-desc-en">Competency Development | Building Lasting Capabilities</text>
            </view>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="section">
        <view class="section-heading">
          <view class="heading-line"></view>
          <view class="heading-texts">
            <text class="section-title">双向成长，共同成就</text>
            <text class="section-title-en">GROWING TOGETHER</text>
          </view>
        </view>

        <view class="bilingual-block">
          <text class="paragraph">嘉谦若竹亲子共学，不只关注孩子成长，更重视妈妈的自我觉醒。我们持续面向积极精进的妈妈开放学习实践机会，助力妈妈从被动陪同者，转变为主动学习者、项目实践者、家庭文脉建设者。</text>
          <text class="paragraph-en">We continually create opportunities for motivated mothers to learn, participate, and put ideas into practice—supporting their transformation from passive companions into active learners, project practitioners, and stewards of their family’s cultural legacy.</text>
        </view>

        <view class="bilingual-block second-block">
          <text class="paragraph">在托举孩子前行的路上，重新发掘自身热爱、能力与价值，走出一条可实践、可持续、具备长期复利的成长道路。</text>
          <text class="paragraph-en">As mothers empower their children to move forward, they also rediscover their own passions, abilities, and value—shaping a path of growth that is practical, sustainable, and capable of generating lifelong rewards.</text>
        </view>

        <view class="closing">
          <text class="closing-cn">各自成长，彼此照见；</text>
          <text class="closing-cn">双向赋能，共同成就。</text>
          <view class="closing-line"></view>
          <text class="closing-en">Growing in our own ways, we illuminate one another.</text>
          <text class="closing-en">Empowering each other, we flourish together.</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
